@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+# Native control: TOTK 1.4.3
+
+TKC1 UDP7075 uses a bounded queue; commands execute only on the game frame thread. Module identity gates the verified component/GameData layout. Current features include player values, bounded input, camera, pouch durability, material/food/device quantity locks, weather and guarded actor spawning. No complete inventory snapshot API is exposed. Catalog generation and synthetic verification use the outer project dual-runtime workflow. Per-candidate scene evidence is required for game validation.
